WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
- Did you ever share a spot of tea?

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.450
'Cause I love, I've had
wine with Kevin Hart.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.770
And I know that you were
making Diehard together,

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.550
and I love this whole
concept of this show.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.943
So like have you ever had tea with him?

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:18.380
- Well, like on set he, do you know what?

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:22.330
He actually introduced me to some tea.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:27.330
He would send someone to
get a specific tea every day

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.650
and it was like peach and like mint

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.563
or peppermint and peach fruity thing.

00:00:35.749 --> 00:00:38.299
- (laughing) Kevin Hart
drinks a fruity (laughing).

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.730
- But it was great, 'cause
it was like really good.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:45.530
It kind of cleared your source
of airways and the sinuses.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:46.363
And it was great.

00:00:46.363 --> 00:00:49.280
Like, especially when you're
on and we were filming

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:54.280
in Atlanta and it was quite
cold and quite like wet

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:57.219
and damp at the time.

00:00:57.219 --> 00:00:58.530
- Any kind of mint, yeah.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:03.433
- Like slightly sweet, kind of
aromatic tea was quite good.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.070
But he liked to tease
me because I always had

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:12.070
my little eco cup thing
with different teas.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.160
And he'd be like, oh,
are you drinking tea?

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:18.490
You know like, 'cause I
always, always had that cup.

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:20.680
- I know, but it's not
just the tea tastes good.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.020
Like it's really healing,
like it's medicine.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.430
And in some forms like
elderberry, echinacea,

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:28.410
like there's so many
things like silver needle.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.453
All these things are
like really good for you.

